OL,3,GNEWSACouncil looking to replace ageing
OL,4,Avehicle fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority in Surrey is looking
OL,7,Fto replace its ageing fleet of vehicles
OL,8,Fafter existing maintenance costs nearly
OL,9,Fdoubled what was budgeted.
OL,11,FGuildford Borough Council (GBC)
OL,12,Fcurrently operates 191 vehicles,
OL,13,Franging from delivery cars to bin
OL,14,Florries, but officers said a majority
OL,15,Fof these are now well beyond their
OL,16,Foperational life expectancy.
OL,18,FA report presented to GBC's overview
OL,19,Fand scrutiny committee added the
OL,20,Fdeteriorating stock is impacting on the
OL,21,Fability to carry out bin collections
OL,22,Fand street cleaning.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
